WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.031
It was a quiet day at Rainbow Reef.

2
00:00:04.032 --> 00:00:06.933
Cora was lying on a rock.

3
00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:12.576
"I'm bored," she thought.

4
00:00:12.577 --> 00:00:19.049
"I wonder if anyone needs help."

5
00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.285
Cora swam to the clam bed.

6
00:00:23.286 --> 00:00:28.496
"Hi, clams! Do you need any help?"

7
00:00:28.497 --> 00:00:30.926
A clam opened her shell.

8
00:00:30.927 --> 00:00:38.288
Bubbles floated out. "Nope!"

9
00:00:38.289 --> 00:00:43.980
A tuskfish was collecting rocks.

10
00:00:43.981 --> 00:00:47.507
"Do you need any help?" Cora asked.

11
00:00:47.508 --> 00:00:50.954
"No, thanks," the tuskfish said.

12
00:00:50.955 --> 00:00:56.671
"This is an easy job."

13
00:00:56.672 --> 00:01:00.125
Cora went back to the rock.

14
00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:03.902
Mo swam over. "What's wrong?"

15
00:01:03.903 --> 00:01:08.059
"I want to help someone," Cora said.

16
00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:14.921
"But nobody needs any help."

17
00:01:14.922 --> 00:01:18.575
"I can teach you sand art," Mo said.

18
00:01:18.576 --> 00:01:25.335
Cora laughed. "I'm bad at art.

19
00:01:25.336 --> 00:01:33.268
But sure. I'll try it."

20
00:01:33.269 --> 00:01:36.679
They swam to a sandy field.

21
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:43.515
Mo drew a big circle.

22
00:01:43.516 --> 00:01:56.318
Next he drew lines.

23
00:01:56.319 --> 00:02:00.253
Cora tried to draw a circle.

24
00:02:00.254 --> 00:02:05.582
"Blah," she said. "It looks like an oval."

25
00:02:05.583 --> 00:02:10.803
Suddenly Mo gasped. "What's that?"

26
00:02:10.804 --> 00:02:15.202
Cora looked up and saw a dark shape.

27
00:02:15.203 --> 00:02:19.274
"It's a skate," Cora said.

28
00:02:19.275 --> 00:02:23.857
"Her name is Sally."

29
00:02:23.858 --> 00:02:29.406
Sally hurried to them. "Please help me!

30
00:02:29.407 --> 00:02:33.906
It's an emergency!"

